MASQUE To Clash (static edition)

An independent, browser-only converter inspired by the option set and
Clash/Mihomo configuration structure of:

  https://m2c.pages.dev/
  https://masque.pages.dev/
  https://github.com/KJGX66F/usque-custom-pro

No source code was copied from those projects. The registration API used by
the original site enforces a referrer whitelist, so this GitHub Pages edition
cannot always register an account directly; it accepts an already generated
MASQUE account JSON and can use a user-supplied compatible registration relay.
Subscriptions are encoded locally in the URL fragment unless an optional
/api/sub compatible hosting API is configured.

